# Keep the Docker build context small. The builder image uses the v2 ROOT as its
# build context (to COPY shared modules from agent/src and loader/), so exclude
# everything the image does not need.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
.git
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
docs
temp
*.md
**/.env
**/tests
